[gd_scene format=3]

; Rimefall, under the Brink (map offset (336.5, -69)): where the jump from the Brink lands, the first room of
; the frozen layer. The fall goes on through a broken dome and ends on a shelf of rime; meltwater that once
; poured through the dome froze into a cascade down the slope behind. Terraces of rime step down west to a
; pilgrim shrine at the slope's foot (the first rest after the jump), then the doorway on to the Choir.
; The sky is only arrived through: nothing climbs back up to the Brink.

